	(text "Bumpers: 2x ITR9606 slotted photo-interrupters on the main board\n(~11 mm tall, set by the bumper mechanism). Emitters in series from VCC-5V-REG,\nswitched by BUMPER_LED_EN (high = on, 100k pull-down). BUMP-x-Q+ reads low when light\npasses the slot (R44/R48 47k pull-ups). The harness bumpers (pins 11-16) are wired in parallel\nas a backup: Q7304 also sinks the harness LED (R30), and either detector pulls BUMP-x-Q+ low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ad919c51-052e-45bc-8e9f-1dbedb71e810")
	)
